gger than when he  will be able to resume those projects  i think this pandemic exposed what's  been going on for  since the beginning he says the pandemic  has highlighted long-term inequality  how dollars brought into new orleans by  tourists don't always find their way  back to the culture bearers who attract  many of those visitors to the city  outcome is always about us but when it  comes to economics  it's without us  [Music]  the pandemic may possibly bring  attention to that  because for once everybody is shut down  you know nobody is open so now  what's going to bring the tourism back

